The changes to einfold 0.2.0 this spike measured: timing output under
EINFOLD_TIMING=1, a runtime environment per session, and a lazy task context
in localize. Apply with `git apply` on python-v0.2.0; build with
CARGO_PROFILE_RELEASE_LTO=thin CARGO_PROFILE_RELEASE_CODEGEN_UNITS=2.

